<pre class=metadata>
Title: Screen Capture Media Query
Shortname: screen-capture-media-query
Level: none
Status: LD
ED: https://arronei.github.io/CSS-Additions/system-media-queries/screen-capture/spec/
Repository: arronei/CSS-Additions
Editor: Arron Eicholz
Abstract: This specification adds the '@media/screen-capture' media feature, which lets a page hide
    account balances, messages, and other personal details while the user is sharing or recording their
    screen. It is a protected media feature: the page's appearance changes, in both the capture and on the
    user's own screen, but the page can't find out that a capture is happening. Script, layout, and the
    network see no difference, so the feature can't be used to detect that the user is in a meeting, and a
    page can't show the people watching anything the user doesn't see.
Markup Shorthands: markdown yes, css yes
Complain About: accidental-2119 no, missing-example-ids yes
Assume Explicit For: yes
</pre>

